+an overdue to-do.</t>
+          <t indent="0" pn="section-4.6.6-6">The &quot;VALARM&quot; calendar component <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> include the &quot;ACTION&quot; and
+&quot;TRIGGER&quot; properties. The &quot;ACTION&quot; property further constrains the
+&quot;VALARM&quot; calendar component in the following ways:</t>
+          <t indent="0" pn="section-4.6.6-7">When the action is &quot;AUDIO&quot;, the alarm can also include one and only
